{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2021-05-24 07:00:00', 'title': 'CENTENE APPOINTS SUZY DEPRIZIO AS CHIEF MARKETING OFFICER', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS, MAY 24, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CENTENE CORPORATION (NYSE: CNC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT SUZY DEPRIZIO HAS BEEN APPOINTED AS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT, CHIEF MARKETING OFFICER, EFFECTIVE TODAY. MS. DEPRIZIO WILL PLAY A CRITICAL ROLE LEADING THE MARKETING STRATEGY, BRAND POSITION AND ADVERTISING FOR THE COMPANY.'}